{"version":1,"content":"<p>41歲《中年好聲音3》亞軍張與辰，不僅粉絲數量急增，就連工作量亦飈升，忙碌背後，張與辰身體響警號，繼6月身體不適要急送院治理後，早前經檢查後，又發現肝功能指數出現異常，有肝脂肪積聚問題，嚇壞粉絲之餘，更令媽媽擔憂。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:01:27.273620+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:27:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T08:38:30.011805+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:58:49.561350+00:00","content_hash":"40f4ee9974b5ea4c54cebb1966b26cd6813e89ab7586ac12263e5550140df3b9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}